//github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L47" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">字段</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public static final BooleanProperty OVERLOAD</code></td><td>初值 <code>IPowerComponent.OVERLOAD</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L48" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">字段</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public PumpBlock(Properties properties)</code></td><td>实现调用 <code>super(properties)</code><br>实现调用 <code>this.stateDefinition.any() .setValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION, Orientation.NORTH_UP)</code><br>实现调用 <code>this.stateDefinition.any()</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L54" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">构造器</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public RenderShape getRenderShape(BlockState state)</code></td><td>客户端选择方块的渲染路径时调用。<br>末尾返回 <code>RenderShape.MODEL</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L67" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public VoxelShape getShape(BlockState state, BlockGetter level, BlockPos pos, CollisionContext ctx)</code></td><td>方块查询选取轮廓时调用。返回方块局部坐标中的 VoxelShape。<br>末尾返回 <code>switch (state.getValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION).getDirection().getAxis()) { case X -&gt; PumpBlock.SHAPE_X; case Y -&gt; PumpBlock.SHAPE_Y; default -&gt; PumpBlock.SHAPE_Z; }</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L72" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override @Nullable public BlockState getStateForPlacement(BlockPlaceContext context)</code></td><td>放置方块时根据点击位置、朝向和相邻状态决定初始 BlockState。<br>末尾返回 <code>this.defaultBlockState() .setValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION, orientation) .setValue(PumpBlock.POWERED, context.getLevel().hasNeighborSignal(context.getClickedPos()))</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L86" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>public static boolean isConnectableFace(BlockState pumpState, Direction faceToNeighbor)</code></td><td>判断泵是否在指定面方向上与邻居形成流体连接。 泵的模型为沿朝向轴延伸的管体，仅有朝向轴两端（输入端 / 输出端）开口， 垂直于朝向轴的面为实体面，不连接流体。<br>参数 <code>pumpState</code> 泵的方块状态<br>参数 <code>faceToNeighbor</code> 从泵看向邻居的方向<br>返回 该面是否为泵的连接面（输入端或输出端）<br><code>(!(pumpState.getBlock() instanceof PumpBlock))</code> 成立时提前返回 <code>false</code><br>末尾返回 <code>faceToNeighbor.getAxis() == pumpState.getValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION).getDirection().getAxis()</code><br><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/api/fluid/network/FluidNetworkScanner.java#L86" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">调用处 FluidNetworkScanner.isConnectablePump</a></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L133" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public void setPlacedBy(Level level, BlockPos pos, BlockState state, @Nullable LivingEntity placer, ItemStack stack)</code></td><td>实现调用 <code>super.setPlacedBy(level, pos, state, placer, stack)</code><br>实现调用 <code>level.isClientSide()</code><br>实现调用 <code>Direction.values()</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L140" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public boolean change(Player player, BlockPos blockPos, Level level, ItemStack anvilHammer)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>true</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L206" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public @Nullable Property&lt;?&gt; getChangeableProperty(BlockState state)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>PumpBlock.ORIENTATION</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L216" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public BlockState rotate(BlockState state, Rotation rotation)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>state.setValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION, state.getValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION).rotate(rotation))</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L221" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public BlockState mirror(BlockState state, Mirror mirror)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>state.setValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION, state.getValue(PumpBlock.ORIENTATION).mirror(mirror))</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L226" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public @Nullable PumpBlockEntity newBlockEntity(BlockPos pos, BlockState state)</code></td><td>为指定位置和状态创建方块实体。<br>末尾返回 <code>ModBlockEntities.PUMP.get().create(pos, state)</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L231" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public @Nullable &lt;T extends BlockEntity&gt; BlockEntityTicker&lt;T&gt; getTicker(Level level, BlockState state, BlockEntityType&lt;T&gt; type)</code></td><td><code>(level.isClientSide())</code> 成立时提前返回 <code>null</code><br>末尾返回 <code>BaseEntityBlock.createTickerHelper(type, ModBlockEntities.PUMP.get(), PumpBlockEntity::tick)</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L236" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>@Override public boolean checkBlockState(BlockState blockState)</code></td><td>末尾返回 <code>false</code></td><td><a href="https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/blob/7ac05a76988c98454c0384513fcab44d9da4cf88/src/main/java/dev/dubhe/anvilcraft/block/fluid/PumpBlock.java#L242" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">方法</a></td></tr></tbody></table>',6)])])}const p=t(r,[["render",o]]);export{f as __pageData,p as default};
